Package: tuxoflood
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pygame (>= 2.1)
Section: games
Priority: optional
Description: penguin-themed colour-flood puzzle with a move limit
 TuxoFlood is a colourful puzzle in the spirit of Flood-It. A penguin
 starts in the top-left corner of a board of coloured ice tiles. Each
 move recolours the penguin's area, which then swallows every touching
 tile of the new colour. Fill the whole board with a single colour
 before the move limit runs out.
 .
 The boards grow from 6x6 with 3 colours to 26x26 with 16 colours, then
 an endless mode follows. The move limit of every board comes from a
 built-in solver. Features include stars and scores, hover preview,
 colour-blind symbols, flood animations, statistics, high scores, sound
 effects and music. The user interface is in Hungarian and English.
